public material + authorized_keys (dot-ssh-clean.tar), user units, crontab,
Claude resident state (transcripts + .claude.json; credential-scanned clean),
exobrain, thermal logs, openclaw trees (openclaw-clean.tar — credential files
removed), toapdd tests, git inventory + dirt records,
dpkg manifest (1,269 packages), model hashes.
REPLICATED (pin/reference only): the Inkling model + mmproj (fleet NFS +
downloads.phext pins), all GitHub-backed git trees (0 unpushed commits at
stage time), OS packages (dpkg manifest), and the intro-prepass work:
intro-prepass-work.tar, 65,054,720 B, sha256
e831f544b46a127fd7f705db0d3008e79ecff76cc8fd6639a04e13f3ca2b33b0,
carried in the bulk layer (node ~/restore-kit/bulk/ + hub snapshot) —
pin-referenced here like the model, because at 102.67 MB the sealed Volumen
exceeded GitHub's 100 MB file limit; the bulk bytes are byte-identical to
the first-pass payload member of the same hash.

BOOT ORDER: restore.sh in the BOOT universe unrolls this file on a fresh OS —
clock first, payloads hash-verified, packages, system config, identity
re-provisioning, state, bulk (from the hub snapshot), model by pin, services,
stage check against STAGE.md, then the WAKE.md merge.

