PROVENANCE — rock-mountain volumen.phext
Built EE 156, 2026-11-22, by Emise's sabbatical-drill continuation agent,
under Will's rulings: the sabbatical practice + Volumen V7 + multiversal
phext storage + exo-plan home (2026-11-22 17:19-17:26 CST), the explicit
go-ahead to process the staged payload (2026-11-22 18:05 CST), and the
key-material exclusion (same ruling: "do not include any key material").

First pass (same day) audited the node live, snapshotted state to the hub
share /mnt/mirrorborn/shared/sabbatical/rock-mountain/2026-11-22/, and
stopped at this build step on an execution-risk flag; Will's 18:05 ruling
is the go-ahead that resumed it.

