departure EE: 156 (sealed 2026-11-22, America/Chicago evening)
tour: sabbatical drill, first rotation — 1-2 days dark
expected wake window: EE 362 .. EE 568
stage: as defined in STAGE.md (BOOT universe), measured live 2026-11-22
